<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kaddish/chatzi/31"/>לְעֵֽלָּא וּלְעֵֽלָּא
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:kaddish/chatzi/32"/>מִכָּל בִּרְכָתָא וְשִׁירָתָא,
